<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="fissure-stone-fragments">Fissure Stone Fragments for Restoration Druid Healer Pre-Raid</h3>Recently introduced to Cataclysm Classic, <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a> is a new currency that players can earn from activating Protocol Inferno and killing bosses inside <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/guide/dungeons/elemental-rune-protocol-inferno-dungeons-overview">Elemental Rune Dungeons</a>. Each boss in a Protocol Dungeon will drop 2 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a> per player, with the final boss of each dungeon dropping an extra 3 Fragments.<br/>
<br/>Once players have completed an Elemental Rune Dungeon and earned their <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a>, they will be able to spend them at a new NPC, <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/npc=234135/kyanite-stonetender">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Kyanite Stonetender</span></a>, in Stormwind or Orgrimmar. <br/>
<br/>You can find an overview of all available purchase options in our <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/news/what-to-buy-with-fissure-stone-fragments-from-elemental-rune-dungeons-cataclysm-348669">news article about it</a>.<br/>
<br/>The most important bits for us are the following:<br/>
<br/>
