<td>80 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a></td></tr>
<tr>
<td>Back</td>
<td>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60232/shroud-of-endless-grief">
<img alt="Shroud of Endless Grief" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_cataclysm_caster_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shroud of Endless Grief</span></a></td>
<td>80 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
<br/>
<br/>This allows us to catch up quickly on multiple slots and gives us more options to progress or finish up with some otherwise highly contested pieces.<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="body-armor">Body Armor for Restoration Druid Healer</h3>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="head-for-restoration-druid-healer">Head for Restoration Druid Healer</h4>Besides the 359 tier helm available via <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/guide/dungeons/elemental-rune-protocol-inferno-dungeons-overview">Elemental Rune Dungeons</a>, there's one other worthwhile 359 pre-raid option here, and it's the Engineering goggles. They are BoP, so you must have the profession to craft them. While on first glance they look like they're missing stats, the Cogwheel "sockets" are actually the equivalent of the secondary stats that are essentially mix and match. <br/>
<br/>It is worth noting that the Engineering helm has better stats than the 359 tier helm. Unless you are using the tier helm to get 4pc, you should be using the goggles instead if you have Engineering.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Helm Enchant</b>: <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62367/arcanum-of-hyjal">
<img alt="Arcanum of Hyjal" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_masterofelements.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcanum of Hyjal</span></a>, Revered <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1158/guardians-of-hyjal">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Guardians of Hyjal</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
