<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="back-for-restoration-druid-healer">Back for Restoration Druid Healer</h4>Previously <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71267/mantle-of-desire">
<img alt="Mantle of Desire" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_cape_firelands_fireset_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mantle of Desire</span></a> was our overall pre-raid BiS until the introduction of <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a> which gives us access to a bunch of 372+ options. If the ilvl has to be reached quickly though and we don't hesitate to invest some gold, we can opt for the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67131/ritssyns-ruminous-drape">
<img alt="Ritssyn's Ruminous Drape" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_cataclysm_caster_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ritssyn's Ruminous Drape</span></a> BoE World drop with a socket.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Cloak Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=75172/lightweave-embroidery">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_thread_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lightweave Embroidery</span></a> (Tailoring) &gt; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74240/enchant-cloak-greater-intellect">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Cloak - Greater Intellect</span></a> <b>+</b> <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=39300/spring-loaded-cloak-expander">
<img alt="Spring Loaded Cloak Expander" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gizmo_05.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Spring Loaded Cloak Expander</span></a> (Engineering)<div class="pad"></div>
