<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="chest-for-restoration-druid-healer">Chest for Restoration Druid Healer</h4>With the release of <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=1977/zulgurub">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Zul'Gurub</span></a> in Phase 2 we got access to a really nice farmable Pre-Raid chest piece until we can afford our tier piece <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71105/obsidian-arborweave-tunic">
<img alt="Obsidian Arborweave Tunic" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_leather_raiddruid_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Obsidian Arborweave Tunic</span></a> or craft ourselves <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56561/chestguard-of-natures-fury">
<img alt="Chestguard of Nature's Fury" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_leather_raiddruid_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Chestguard of Nature's Fury</span></a>. Keep in mind that eventually we want to reach our 4p <a data-entity="item-set" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item-set=1004/obsidian-arborweave-vestments">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Obsidian Arborweave Vestments</span></a> once we step into the raid.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Chest Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74250/enchant-chest-peerless-stats">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Chest - Peerless Stats</span></a> &gt; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74191/enchant-chest-mighty-stats">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Chest - Mighty Stats</span></a> (budget)<div class="pad"></div>
