<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="wrist-for-restoration-druid-healer">Wrist for Restoration Druid Healer</h4>Not a lot of options on this slot. Thankfully now with P3 we finally got some alternatives for <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56297/armbands-of-change">
<img alt="Armbands of Change" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Armbands of Change</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Bracer Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=85010/draconic-embossment-intellect">
