<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="hands-for-restoration-druid-healer">Hands for Restoration Druid Healer</h4>Since the balance set tier gloves are so well itemized, you should go ahead and set this slot as your buyable "off-piece" of choice and buy the 378 tier version to upgrade it to 391 later. <br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Glove Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74198/enchant-gloves-haste">
