<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="waist-for-restoration-druid-healer">Waist for Restoration Druid Healer</h4>With the introduction of <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a> we gained the option to choose between a fixed 50 Fragment investment or a little affix gamble via <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=232950/satchel-of-the-gale-rouser-belt">
