<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="legs-for-restoration-druid-healer">Legs for Restoration Druid Healer</h4>Since we plan to maintain our 4p <a data-entity="item-set" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item-set=1004/obsidian-arborweave-vestments">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Obsidian Arborweave Vestments</span></a> with our 391 tier legs, it is recommended to spend our <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
