<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="feet-for-restoration-druid-healer">Feet for Restoration Druid Healer</h4>One of the easier slots to gear. It's either BoEs from <a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/skill=165/leatherworking">
<img alt="Leatherworking" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_armorkit_17.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leatherworking</span></a> or <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> if it has to be quick or we farm <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
