<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="jewelry">Jewelry for Restoration Druid Healer</h3>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="neck-for-restoration-druid-healer">Neck for Restoration Druid Healer</h4>Gone are the days of the very expensive and rare neck BoE <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67130/dorians-lost-necklace">
<img alt="Dorian's Lost Necklace" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_forestnecklace.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dorian's Lost Necklace</span></a> being absolute BiS. With <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71214/firemind-pendant">
<img alt="Firemind Pendant" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_neck_hyjaldaily_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Firemind Pendant</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69882/planetary-amulet">
<img alt="Planetary Amulet" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/item_icecrownnecklaced.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Planetary Amulet</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70106/nightweavers-amulet">
<img alt="Nightweaver's Amulet" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_neck_hyjaldaily_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nightweaver's Amulet</span></a> we have some way better alternatives that wont sit heavy on our gold stash.<div class="pad"></div>
