<br/>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="weapons">Weapons for Restoration Druid Healer</h3>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="staff-weapons-for-restoration-druid-healer">Staff Weapons for Restoration Druid Healer</h4>Hopefully, you aren't completely tired of Archaeology if you opt to play with a staff for any reason this phase. Both our 359 options here are from either Dwarf or Tol'vir Archaeology. Either are basically equally good, though you might slightly prefer the spirit for early progression. If you haven't been lucky enough to find one of them yet, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69624/legacy-of-arlokk">
<img alt="Legacy of Arlokk" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_staff_35.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Legacy of Arlokk</span></a> is the next best Staff option.<br/>
<br/>Keep in mind if you aren't looking to do Archaeology, an equal ilvl one-handed weapon + off hand has slightly better stats than a staff. This will hold true for all of Cataclysm (note that even with a slightly lower ilvl offhand, the 1h+oh combo will generally be better than an equal ilvl staff as long as the mainhand is the same ilvl due to the available off hand enchant).<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Weapon Enchants</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74242/enchant-weapon-power-torrent">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulasuperior_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Weapon - Power Torrent</span></a> &gt; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74225/enchant-weapon-heartsong">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Weapon - Heartsong</span></a> (budget)<div class="pad"></div>
