<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="off-hands-for-restoration-druid-healer">Off Hands for Restoration Druid Healer</h4>Off hands change slightly in Cataclysm to not have any spellpower. Instead they just make up for the Int/<wbr/>Stam/<wbr/>secondary stat difference that a staff would make. In general, this means that the actual stat value of off hands is much higher than in Wrath. That being said, most of the item budget for caster weapons is still mostly in the weapon itself.<br/>
<br/>Overall this means that even if you have to wear a lower ilvl off hand to wear the comparable ilvl main hand vs a staff, the mh+oh will have better or comparable stats due to the new off hand enchant. <br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70112/globe-of-moonlight">
<img alt="Globe of Moonlight" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_orb_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Globe of Moonlight</span></a> is the best option we have, however, it is another item from the <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5733/molten-front">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Molten Front</span></a> quest hub. The best alternative is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=59513/scepter-of-ice">
<img alt="Scepter of Ice" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_crystallized_water.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Scepter of Ice</span></a>, which is yet another <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/guide/dungeons/elemental-rune-protocol-inferno-dungeons-overview">Elemental Rune Dungeons</a> drop. <br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Off-Hand Enchants</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74235/enchant-off-hand-superior-intellect">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Off-Hand - Superior Intellect</span></a>
