<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="relics-for-restoration-druid-healer">Relics for Restoration Druid Healer</h4>Relics are very straightforward in Cataclysm, they are just stat sticks that are universal across <span class="c11">Druids</span>, <span class="c2">Paladins</span> and <span class="c7">Shamans</span>. <br/>
<br/>Keep in mind for the with <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> purchaseable relics, the overall stat gain is very low so despite the low price tag, you should generally hold off buying it for as long as possible.<div class="pad"></div>
